      "properties": {},
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "title": "Front, side and back to painted .vox with Hunyuan3D",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Front, side and back to painted .vox with Hunyuan3D\nNeeds [ComfyUI-Hunyuan3DWrapper](https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-Hunyuan3DWrapper) and `hunyuan3d-dit-v2-mv_fp16.safetensors` in `models/diffusion_models`. The first run downloads the delight and paint models into `models/diffusers`.\n\n1. Upload the front picture on **Front View**, the profile on **Side View** and the subject from behind on **Back View**, all with the background in alpha and at the same pixel scale. Keep **side_faces** on `left` on both framing nodes.\n2. Set **maximum_size** on **Save Voxel Model**: the voxels along the model's longest axis.\n3. Press **Run**, then **Download** on Save Voxel Model. **Save Textured Mesh** keeps the painted mesh in `output/3D`.\n\nHunyuan3D-2mv makes the shape from all three pictures. The painter takes the front only: it is delit on gray, painted into six views of the shape (**Painted Views**), baked into the mesh's texture, and the voxelizer averages **samples_per_voxel** texture samples into each voxel.\n\nWithout a back picture, select **Back View** and press Ctrl+B.\n\nEvery Run uses new shape and paint seeds; set control_after_generate to fixed to repeat one."
      ]
    }
  ],
